hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2210","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Kaash main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey na suna hota: Maut ki tamanna na karo! To main tamanna karta. (Bukhari: 7233)"
"2211","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein koi maut ki tamanna na karey. Ya nekokaar, shayed wo badhey. Ya gunaahgaar, shayed wo tauba karey. (Bukhari: 7235). Kitaab aur Sunnat ko mazboot pakadney ki kitaab."
